{
  "info": {
    "name": "Pre-IPO Trading Platform",
    "description": "Tokenized pre-IPO share trading against a stablecoin balance.\n\n**Getting started**\n1. Run `Auth > Login (Alice)` \u2014 the bearer token is captured into the `token` collection variable automatically.\n2. Everything else is ready to send.\n\n**Money** is sent and returned as decimal *strings* to avoid IEEE-754 rounding on the client.\n\n**Errors** always look like `{ \"error\": { \"code\", \"message\", \"details\" }, \"path\", \"timestamp\" }` \u2014 switch on `error.code`, never on the message.\n\n**Idempotency**: `POST /orders` requires an `Idempotency-Key` header. A collection-level pre-request script generates a fresh UUID for every send; replay a key deliberately by pinning the `idempotencyKey` variable.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// A fresh Idempotency-Key per send, so retries are explicit rather than accidental.",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('idempotencyKey', require('uuid').v4());"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "orderId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "symbol",
      "value": "vSOL",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "idempotencyKey",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Creates an account and credits the welcome stablecoin balance.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"trader@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123!\",\n  \"displayName\": \"New Trader\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.accessToken) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', body.user.id);",
                  "  console.log('token stored for', body.user.email);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('authenticated', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Alice)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Seeded trader. Stores the bearer token in the `token` variable.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"alice@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123!\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
